# HIVE indexes this repository from inside a Linux container that applies no line-ending
# conversion, so a CRLF working tree is read as every tracked file being modified and its
# staleness guard then refuses canonical retrieval. Text is LF on every platform, and the
# working tree must match the blobs byte for byte.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.glb binary
*.fbx binary
*.mesh binary
*.anim binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.pdb binary
*.res binary
*.dylib binary
*.so binary
*.a binary
*.mov binary
*.mp4 binary
*.node binary
